===Verb===
{{ro-verb|trece|trecut}}

# {{lb|ro|intransitive}} to [[pass]] by, through, etc. {{gl|enter and then leave an object’s vicinity or insides}}
#: {{ux|ro|'''Trece''' grăbit fără să salute.|He '''passes''' hurriedly by without saying hello.}}
# {{lb|ro|chiefly|intransitive|with|{{m|ro|de}}}} to have [[pass]]ed something {{gl|leave behind in one’s path}}
#: {{ux|ro|Șoferul a '''trecut''' de ieșirea de pe autostradă fără să o observe.|The driver '''passed''' the highway exit without noticing it.}}
## {{lb|ro|intransitive|with|{{m|ro|de}}}} to [[exceed]] a value
##: {{ux|ro|Luna aceasta temperaturile nu vor '''trece''' de 10 de grade.|Temperatures will not exceed 10° this month.}}
## {{lb|ro|intransitive|figurative}} to [[leave behind]], [[come to terms]] with something {{+preo|ro|peste}}
# {{lb|ro|transitive}} to [[cross]] a road, a river etc.
# {{lb|ro|intransitive|of time}} to [[pass]] {{gl|go by}}
# {{lb|ro|intransitive}} to [[pass]] {{gl|be in the past}}
## {{lb|ro|of a sensation, state, emotion}} to be [[over]], [[pass]], [[cease]], no longer be felt by someone {{+obj|ro|dat}}
# {{lb|ro|intransitive}} [[approach]] a new action or subject {{+preo|ro|la}}
#: {{coi|ro|a '''trece''' la fapte|to walk the walk}}
#: {{ux|ro|După montare voi '''trece''' la vopsire.|After putting it together, I’ll go on to paint it.}}
#: {{ux|ro|Să '''trecem''' acum la experiența dumneavoastră profesională.|Let’s now '''discuss''' your work experience.}}
# {{lb|ro|intransitive}} to make a [[visit]], [[come over]] {{+preo|ro|([[pe]]) [[la]]|person or place}}
# {{lb|ro|transitive}} to [[keep track]], [[catalogue]], [[register]], [[list]] data in writing {{+preo|ro|în|means of record}}
# {{lb|ro|ambitransitive|informal}} to [[pass]] a test
# {{lb|ro|transitive|informal}} to [[pass]] a student
# {{lb|ro|copulative}} to [[pass for]] {{+preo|ro|drept}}
# {{lb|ro|intransitive|colloquial|chiefly|imperative|potentially rude}} to [[go]], [[move]]
#: {{uxi|ro|'''Treci''' înapoi în bancă.|Back to your desk.}}
# {{lb|ro|intransitive|less common}} to [[turn into]], [[develop]] into {{+preo|ro|în}}
# {{lb|ro|reflexive|of produce}} to become [[overripe]], go [[out of season]]
# {{lb|ro|reflexive|chiefly in the negative|obsolete|rare|of an endeavour}} to [[succeed]] for someone {{+obj|ro|dat}}
# {{lb|ro|reflexive|most­ly|_|obsolete|of deceit or claims}} to be [[believe]]d

